{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-08766a", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "元稿「収蔵票の、来歴の欄」を、書記室名詞を全て落とした戸口の麻糸へ変奏する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-ee4627", "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-08766a", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "元稿の「書かないと決めた空欄」に、名を付けなかったがゆえに返せない朝を対置する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-39b5d7", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "反歌。名を訊かないという言い切りを、「返せ」の要求で正面から切る。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-12186d", "relation_type": "interrupts", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "第1編は結び目だけを壁に残して去り、翌朝の声に場所を空ける。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-24579f", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "自分の語彙を暴く文体を、名詞の禁止という形式で試す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-d71988", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-1ddf47", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "名詞を消しても動詞が手続きを運ぶ、という反証を同じ問いへ突きつける。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-e8f247", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-1ddf47", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "版の同一性を、共有された名ではなく重さと声の長さの差に置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-55a05a", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-082", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "同一性は名を与える指が決める、という別解を並置して畳まない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-981b39", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-082", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "留保なき言い切りを一篇に置き、統合を断片間の衝突へ先送りする。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-5374c7", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-017", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "「かえせ」を、要求ではなく返却の宛先が消えた形式として受け取る。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-3af72d", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-a80181", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "書かないことを形式の差として置き、触れた数の余りを数えないまま終える。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-b3d96c", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261025-1bef5a", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "書き残した動詞の手つきを、新しい問いへ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-8e13e9", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "Q-20261121-198fc8", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "返却不能という結果を、新しい問いへ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-981ca1", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "Q-20261121-198fc8", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "Q-20261025-1ddf47", "type": "question"}, "note": "婉曲語の問いを、名詞から動詞の層へ開き直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-130b83", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "Q-20261121-198fc8", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "Q-20261025-1ddf47", "type": "question"}, "note": "問いが変奏稿の側に置いた課題：語彙の禁止は何を残すか。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-3c06ad", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261030-488cb1", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "「空欄を書かないと決めるには、まず欄が要る」を、欄そのものを撤去した側から受け直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-5e332c", "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-dd818f", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "欄がなくても結び目が番号になる。足の九日と十一の結び目を同じ数の問題へ組み替える。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-89e381", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261030-488cb1", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-21", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-916e3f", "type": "material"}, "note": "名前のついた一個が多数の代わりに置かれる非対称を、十一の同じ結び目へ響かせる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261121-5b12cc", "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261121-3f6e02", "type": "fragment"}}
